/**
 * No internal or diagnostic language reaches a member.
 *
 * Two halves, deliberately.
 *
 *   1. The rules, as pure functions: what a program is called, what the
 *      interim description says, and which stored text is suppressed.
 *   2. The rendered screens, against a workout carrying the EXACT strings
 *      a real assigned workout on production carries today. A member never
 *      sees a pattern name, a severity, "auto-generated" or a generation
 *      seed, and the assertion is made on real HTML rather than on source
 *      text, so a future refactor that reintroduces a leak fails here.
 *
 * The coach side is asserted too, in the negative: the clinical names must
 * still be exactly what they were, because a coach reads a finding and a
 * member reads a program.
 */
